Note: SessionEvent is an internally-tagged serde enum (`#[serde(tag = "type",
rename_all = "snake_case")]`) and is `#[non_exhaustive]`. JournalEnvelope carries
`#[serde(deny_unknown_fields)]`. Every frame is SHA-256 chained.
`enforce_event_schema_boundary` applies its frozen 49-name allow-list ONLY when
the frame declares schema_version == 4; v5 frames are not checked against it.

